Hook Example: Format Files
After Claude Edits Them
SETTINGS POSTTOOLUSE
{
"hooks": {
"PostToolUse": [
{
"matcher": "Edit|Write",
"hooks": [
{
"type": "command",
"command": "npx prettier --write ."
}
]
}
]
}
}
Now formatting doesn't depend on Claude remembering:
Please run Prettier.
It happens automatically.
